---
// ZONE 1 — The Surface. Light, airy hero. The dive starts here.
---
<section id="surface" class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#eef7f6] via-[#d5eae7] to-[#a9d8d2]"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="absolute -top-40 left-1/2 h-[640px] w-[640px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-[#fff6cf]/70 blur-[140px]"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pt-36 pb-60 text-center md:pt-44 md:pb-80">
    <p
      class="reveal font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.35em] text-ink-900/55 uppercase md:text-xs"
    >
      Octopy &middot; Independent software studio
    </p>

    <h1
      class="reveal mt-8 font-display text-5xl leading-[1.02] font-medium tracking-tight text-ink-900 md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl"
      style="--reveal-delay: 90ms"
    >
      Software built<br />to <em class="font-light">hold pressure.</em>
    </h1>

    <p
      class="reveal mx-auto mt-8 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-900/65 md:text-lg"
      style="--reveal-delay: 180ms"
    >
      Octopy is an independent studio crafting reliable web applications and server
      infrastructure. This site is a descent &mdash; scroll, and go deeper.
    </p>

    <div
      class="reveal mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row"
      style="--reveal-delay: 270ms"
    >
      <a
        href="#twilight"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full bg-ink-900 px-7 py-3.5 font-mono text-sm text-foam-50 transition-transform duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        Begin the descent
        <i class="ph ph-arrow-down text-base"></i>
      </a>
      <a
        href="#midnight"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-ink-900/20 px-7 py-3.5 font-mono text-sm text-ink-900 transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-ink-900/50"
      >
        Meet the founder
      </a>
    </div>

    <p
      class="reveal mt-14 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] text-ink-900/45 uppercase"
      style="--reveal-delay: 360ms"
    >
      &minus;0 m &middot; The Surface
    </p>
  </div>

  <svg
    class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-24 w-full text-twilight-700 md:h-32"
    viewBox="0 0 1440 120"
    preserveAspectRatio="none"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <path
      fill="currentColor"
      d="M0,64 C240,118 480,8 720,52 C960,96 1200,28 1440,74 L1440,120 L0,120 Z"
    ></path>
  </svg>
</section>
